Author-Name: KEUNINGS, R.
Author-Workplace-Name: Division of Applied Machanics, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Author-Name: WOLSEY, laurence
Author-Email: laurence.wolsey@uclouvain.be
