Author-Name: DOUKHAN, P.
Author-Workplace-Name: U.R.A., Université Paris-Sud, France
Author-Name: TSYBAKOV, A.
Author-Workplace-Name: Institute for Problems of Information Transmission Academy of Sciences, Moscow and CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve Belgium
Title: Non Linear ARX-Models : Probabilistic Properties and Consistent Recursive Estimation
Abstract: Consider the general ARX(k, q) nonlinear process defined by the recurrence relation Yn = f(Y_(n-1),... y_(n-k), x_n,..., x_(n-q+1)) +([ xi ]_n) where { x_n},{ [xi]_n} are independent i.i.d. sequences. We study some probabilistic properties of this process in the ergodic situation and propose a recursive estimator of the stochastic gradient kind of the function f which is strongly consistent.
