Author-Workplace-Name: Institut de Statistiques and CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: On the Distribution of Jumps of the Dirichlet Process
Abstract: In this paper, a new and very easily tractable description of the Dirichlet process with diffuse parameter is presented. This description permits to simulate the posterior distribution of the nonparametric Bayesian Statistical Analysis of an i.i.d. sample.
Classification-JEL: F15, G99, G57, C05, G42, G50
Keywords: Dirichlet Process, Nonparametric Bayesian Statistics
