Author-Name: SICONOLFI, Paolo
Author-Workplace-Name: Graduate School of Business, Columbia University
Title: Generic Existence of Competitive Equilibria when the Asset Market is Incomplete : A Symmetric Argument
Abstract: The argument for the generic existence of competitive equilibria when the asset market is incomplete can be formulated with symmetric treatment of all individuals.
Classification-JEL: D51, D52
Keywords: existence of competitive equilibria, incomplete asset market
