Author-Name: BANERJEE , Anurag N.
Author-Workplace-Name: CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: A Method of Estimating the Average Derivative
Abstract: This work describes a method of estimating the Average Derivative  [ delta ]= E(m')  (where 'm' is the regression function). The method unlike Hardie-Stoker (JASA, 1989) method, uses local linear regression, and is a "direct" estimate of  [ delta ]. Some large sample properties have been obtained, and the two methods have been compared using simulation studies.
