Author-Workplace-Name: CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: A Role for Monetary Policy when Prices reveal Information : An Example
Abstract: In an example, monetary policy can determine the information revealed by prices, and thus it can be effective, even desirable.
