Author-Workplace-Name: CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: The Voting Mechanism and Market Allocation : A Note
Abstract: An example is provided identifying a case of inefficiency arising from the interplay of the voting mechanism and the market mechanism.
