Author-Name: HARA , Chiaki
Author-Workplace-Name: CORE, Université catholique de Louvain, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: Marginal Rates of Substitution for Uninsurable Risks with Constrained-Efficient Asset Structures
Abstract: We study efficient allocations of contingent commodities in economies in which security markets are incomplete and the payoff structures of securities are somehow endogenously determined. We present a notion of efficiency in this setup, which takes the payoff structures as endogenous variables, and give first- and second- order conditions for an allocation to be efficient. We then etablish some differential properties ot the set of efficient allocations.
