Author-Workplace-Name: Université catholique de Louvain, CORE, B-1348 Louvain-la-Neuve, Belgium
Title: Utility theory and ethics
Abstract: This chapter discusses various technical constructions and philosophical interpretations of utility theory with a view of establishing its relevance to social ethics.
