Title: Cournot-Nash equilibria in limit exchange economies with complete markets: a comparison between two models
Abstract: In this paper, we compare, in the framework of exchange economies with an atomless continuum of traders, two models of noncooperative exchange “a` la Cournot-Nash” with consistent prices which belong to a line of reseach initiated by Shapley and Shubik (1977).
