Author-Email: rochon@core.ucl.ac.be
Author-Workplace-Name: Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Université catholique de Louvain (UCL), Louvain la Neuve, Belgium
Title: Liquidity constraints and cycles
Abstract: In this paper, we modify the model of Benhabib and Laroque in which the behaviour of non steady-state equilibria in the neighborhood of the golden rule steady state are studied, to include liquidity constraints. We observe, in an example, the appearance of new cycles.
Classification-JEL: E32, E37, E47
Keywords: Overlapping Generations Models, Money, Liquidity Constraints, Cycles. 
