Author-Name: GERARD-VARET, Louis-André
Author-Workplace-Name: GREMAQ, Ecole des Hautes Etudes en Sciences Sociales, Marseille
Title: Unique implementation in auctions and in public goods problems
Abstract: We present new conditions that guarantee the existence of mechanism with a unique or essentially unique equilibrium in auctions and public goods problems with semi-linear utility functions. These conditions bear only on the information structures of the agents
