Author-Name: NESTEROV , Yurii
Author-Workplace-Name: Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Université catholique de Louvain (UCL), Louvain la Neuve, Belgium
Title: Parabolic target space and primal-dual interior-point methods
Abstract: In this paper we develop new primal-dual interior-point methods for linear programming, which are based on the concept of parabolic target space. We show that such schemes work in the inﬁnity-neighborhood of the primal-dual central path. Nevertheless these methods possess the best known complexity estimate. We demonstrate that the adaptivestep path-following strategies can be naturally incorporated in such schemes
Keywords: Linear programming, interior-point methods, target following methods
