Author-Name: GRAZZINI, Lisa
Author-Email: grazzini@core.ucl.ac.be
Author-Workplace-Name: Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Université catholique de Louvain (UCL), Louvain la Neuve, Belgium
Title: Taxing market power
Abstract: We investigate the effectiveness of tax and transfer policies in correcting market distortions when the economy is imperfectly competitive. We perform this analysis in the context of an exchange model representing a bilateral oligopoly situation, which constitutes a particular example of a Shapley-Shubik strategic market game.
Classification-JEL: H30, L13, C72, D51 
Keywords: Imperfect competition, Taxation, Strategic market game 
