Author-Name: NESTEROV, Yurii
Author-Email: yurii.nesterov@uclouvain.be
Author-Workplace-Name: University of Bergamo, Italy and Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Université catholique de Louvain (UCL), Belgium
Title: Stable flows in transportation networks
Abstract: In this paper we develop a new theory of static equilibrium in congested transportation networks. Our considerations are based on a physical meaning of the flows rather than on an artificially chosen model of travel time functions. We introduce a concept of the stable equilibrium and prove the existence theorems.
