Author-Name: NESTEROV, Yurii
Author-Email: yurii.nesterov@uclouvain.be
Author-Workplace-Name: Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Université catholique de Louvain (UCL), 1348 Louvain la Neuve, Belgium
Title: Global quadratic optimization on the sets with simplex structure
Abstract: In the first part of this paper we prove that the global quadratic optimization problem over a simplex can be solved with a constant relative accuracy. In the second part we consider some natural extensions of the result.
Series: UCLouvain, LIDAM, CORE
Number: 1999015
Creation-Date: 1999-02-11
File-URL: https://sites.uclouvain.be/core/publications/coredp/coredp1999.html
File-Format: text/html
Handle: RePEc:cor:louvco:1999015

