Title: Arbitrage and equilibrium with exchangeable risks
Abstract: In an economy with a non-atomic measure space of assets and exchangeable risks, the Arbitrage Pricing Theory (APT) holds exactly; and factors are structurally specified, which allows for an economic interpretation.
Classification-JEL: G12, D52
