Author-Name: DEHEZ, Pierre
Title: Fixed costs and the axiomatization of Shapley’s sharing rule
Abstract: The cost sharing rule derived from the Shapley value is the unique sharing rule which allocates fixed costs uniformly.
Classification-JEL: C71, D46
Keywords: cost sharing, value, ﬁxed cost
