Title: Sufficiency of cut-generating functions
Abstract: This note settles an open problem about cut-generating functions, a concept that has its origin in the work of Gomory and Johnson from the 1970’s and has received renewed attention in recent years.
Keywords: mixed integer programming, separation, corner polyhedron, intersection cuts
