Abstract: In this paper I examine whether ﬁrms report zero proﬁts as a tax evasion strategy by testing the e ects on bunching at zero of an exogenous shock to the cost of evasion in Portugal. I develop a unique identiﬁcation strategy by exploiting the targeting of 
